              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او از مادر پیرش مراقبت میکند. u az mâdar-e pirash morâqebat mikonad. She looks after her elderly mother."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "az kasi morâqebat kardan. morâqeb bâsh — take care."
