            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ورزش برای سلامتی خوب است. varzesh barâ-ye salâmati khub ast. Exercise is good for your health."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a toast and a wish: be salâmati 'cheers, to your health'."
            }
